[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0010","text":"──差不多开始吧？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0020","text":"……那下次休息就定在中午左右……吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0030","text":"嗯嗯！那样的话就大家一起吃饭吧！\n在那之前加油吧！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0002","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0040","text":"……两个人\n我知道的……你们一直在努力这件事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0003","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0050","text":"灯织酱……？／嗯嗯？！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0004","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0060","text":"……对不起……我……\n那位导演说的话，其实我非常无法接受"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0070","text":"真乃和巡都这么努力了……\n为什么还要说那种否定的话……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0005","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0080","text":" 真的太不甘心了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0090","text":"灯织…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0100","text":"嗯……那天灯织也说了\n说不能再继续努力了，果然还是……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0006","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0007","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0110","text":"真乃……巡——……\n……我那天之后，一直有种说不出的憋闷……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0120","text":"但是制作人，告诉了我们他相信我们\n相信我们，也相信偶像这件事"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0130","text":"……电台录音那天也是那样\n从一开始，就没有怀疑过……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0008","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0140","text":"——……所以，我想，我大概……\n对自己也没能完全认同——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0150","text":"啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0160","text":"……是吗……是啊……\n所以——……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0014","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0170","text":"──……开始练习吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0180","text":"——嗯"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0009","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0190","text":"──面向碧蓝的天空，传达过去"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0013","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_01030000_05_0200","text":"预备——"}]
